o Unity 6.3.8f1. Fixed bug where FFT note buckets were higher than FFT available top frequency. This caused many visual effects to stop tracking audio correctly in Unity6.", "created_date": 1772641105, "id": "25706420672393297", "version": "2.0.4", "version_code": 2004, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3485430611585621", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25706420672393297"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "3884256074957968"}]}, "change_log": "# 2.0.2 (20251206)\n\nFixed device tracking offset for OpenXR relative mode, and adjusted various assets to match.\n\n# 2.0.1 (20251206)\n\nSecurity update for Unity.\n\nBug fixes: Lots of things ...\nMaintenance: Unity 2022.3.62f2\n", "created_date": 1765051207, "id": "24952925571076148", "version": "2.0.2", "version_code": 2002, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3485430611585621", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25706420672393297"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1765029144, "id": "24950632024638836", "version": "2.0.1", "version_code": 2001, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3485430611585621", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25706420672393297"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "3884256074957968"}]}, "change_log": "# 0.193 (20241127)\n\nRework to use OpenXR under the hood.\n\nThis has been an interesting challenge, but hopefully it's now all done!\nPlease get in touch if you have any issues.\n\nBug fixes: Lots of things ...\nMaintenance: Unity 2022.3.50, OpenXR 1.13.1", "created_date": 1732733768, "id": "8486321068163192", "version": "0.193", "version_code": 193, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3485430611585621", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25706420672393297"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "3884256074957968"}]}, "change_log": "# 0.180 (20230830)\n\nNOTICE FOR QUEST 1 USERS\n\ndue to Meta making the Quest 1 hardware obsolete, future updates will most likely be restricted to Quest 2 and\nfuture hardware. This release may well be the last version for Quest 1 hardware. Please do get in touch if you are\nrunning Visualiser on Quest 1 and find any breaking issues!\n\nBug fix: menu system gesture now working again.\nPerformance: lots of performance tweaks.\n\nMaintenance: Unity 2022.3.7, OVR 50 (1.82)", "created_date": 1693423574, "id": "6309905172471470", "version": "0.180", "version_cod